{"sections":[{"slug":"导出代数几何","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"导出代数几何"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">导出代数几何</span>"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">学科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"导出代数几何"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"学科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">导出代数几何是使用</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/无穷范畴","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">高阶范畴</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">语言建立的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/代数几何","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">代数几何</span>"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">传统代数几何的基本代数对象是</span><strong><span lang=\"zh\">集合</span></strong><span lang=\"zh\">范畴中的交换环</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">而导出代数几何将其替换为无穷范畴语境中的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/交换代数","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">交换代数</span>"}},{"Plain":", <span lang=\"zh\">其一种模型是所谓连合</span> (connective) <span lang=\"zh\">交换</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/微分分次代数","text":"DG <span lang=\"zh\">代数</span>"}},{"Plain":". <span lang=\"zh\">由此</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">与传统的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/函子式代数几何","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">函子式代数几何</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">类似的思路可以定义仿射概形</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">叠等几何对象</span>.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">在</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/单纯百科","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">单纯百科</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">中</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">由于我们常常默认无穷范畴语境</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">故有关代数几何的概念常常默认属于导出代数几何</span>.</p>\n"}]}}}]}